  _tips:
  - _situation: 0
    _text: KEYS IN. PARK HER STRAIGHT IN THE BAY.
  - _situation: 1
    _text: MUDDY ONE. SEND HER THROUGH THE WASH.
  - _situation: 2
    _text: BATTERY'S DRY. HOOK HER TO THE CHARGER.
  - _situation: 3
    _text: THEY'RE LOSING PATIENCE. HURRY IT UP.
  - _situation: 4
    _text: QUEUE'S FULL. TAKE 'EM ONE BY ONE.
  - _situation: 5
    _text: EASY NOW. DENTS COST YOU BLESSINGS.
  _curse:
  - WELL, THAT WENT SOUR.
  - THAT'LL LEAVE A MARK.
  - ANGRY FOLK. HAPPENS.
  _perfectPark:
  - NICE AND STRAIGHT. GOOD WORK.
  - CAN'T FAULT THAT PARKING.
  - RIGHT IN THE MIDDLE. SHARP.
  _perfectDropOff:
  - RIGHT AT THE CURB. GOOD.
  - THAT PATRON'S HAPPY. GOOD WORK.
  - SMOOTH HANDOVER.
  _bigCrash:
  - WHOA! MIND THE FENCE!
  - THAT'LL BUFF OUT. MAYBE.
  - WATCH THE WALLS!
  _halfwayToGoal:
  - HALFWAY. STEADY NOW.
  - HALF THE BLESSINGS. KEEP AT IT.
  - GOOD PACE. KEEP GOING.
  _goalReached:
  - THAT'S ENOUGH BLESSINGS. WELL DONE.
  - DONE AND DUSTED.
  - GOOD HARVEST TONIGHT.
  _last30Seconds:
  - THIRTY SECONDS. PUSH ON.
  - NEARLY CLOSING. LAST PUSH!
  - ALMOST DONE. STAY SHARP.
